Conclusion: every cross-file import outside a journey's own folder resolves to
@/components/atoms, @/components/molecules, @/components/organisms/{KpiGrid,PageHead,EventStream}
or @/composables / @/i18n / @/lib -- all pre-existing shared tiers. No file under
src/components/import/ imports from src/components/settings|campaigns|automations, and no
popups-widget-editor or dashboard file imports from src/components/import/. No cross-journey
import beyond shared components found.
